OL,3,ACouncil ordered to disclose 24,000 Sara
OL,4,ASharif files
OL,5,
OL,6,FA coroner leading the inquest into the
OL,7,Fdeath of Sara Sharif has ordered Surrey
OL,8,FCounty Council to disclose more than
OL,9,F24,000 documents.
OL,11,FSara, 10, was found dead at her family
OL,12,Fhome in Woking, with her father Urfan
OL,13,FSharif and stepmother Beinash Batool
OL,14,Fjailed for life in 2024 for murder.
OL,16,FA pre-inquest review heard that the
OL,17,Finquest, originally scheduled for
OL,18,FApril, will be pushed back by a further
OL,19,Fsix months to October 2027.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,311,300,200,140,0,100
