OL,3,ACouncil ordered to disclose 24,000 Sara
OL,4,ASharif files
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe eight-week inquest will examine
OL,7,Fwhat state agencies knew, or ought to
OL,8,Fhave known, about Sara's safety before
OL,9,Fshe was murdered.
